OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mixture of
OL,6,Fvariable cloud and some clear spells
OL,7,Fthrough the evening and overnight.
OL,8,FStaying mostly dry but the odd
OL,9,Fpossible at times. Light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FA few scattered light showers
OL,12,Fabout on a mainly cloudy day with only
OL,13,Fa few brighter spells breaking
OL,14,Fthrough. Winds light, mainly from the
OL,15,Fsouthwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
